<title>TANZANIA: Tanzanian shilling weakens versus dollar.</title>
<headline>Tanzanian shilling weakens versus dollar.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling weakened on Wednesday against both the dollar and pound, dealers from the central Bank of Tanzania (BoT) said.</p>
<p>They posted the shilling at 596.9700 compared to the dollar from 596.4453 while against the pound, the shilling was posted at 961.5426 compared to 960.5782 previously.</p>
</text>
